<title>USA: AGA weekly natgas stocks delayed by computer hitch.</title>
<headline>AGA weekly natgas stocks delayed by computer hitch.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Gas Association said on Wednesday its weekly natural gas storage figures were delayed by a computer problem.</p>
<p>A spokesman said the data would likely be released later Wednesday, but was unable to specify a time.</p>
<p>The scheduled release time was 4 p.m. EST (2100 GMT).</p>
